{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/2cd96c1144b458e2df805871448a63aa.webp?t=1755658757\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Farming Frontier</strong> is a relaxing farming adventure game where you can chop wood, mine ores, fish, grow crops, bake bread, and raise cattle at your own pace. Alongside the open-ended sandbox gameplay, the game also follows a light, linear story where your farming skills are key to overcoming enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/8b2bea2d25005d1568fb79daeb948b04.poster.avif?t=1755658757\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/8b2bea2d25005d1568fb79daeb948b04.webm?t=1755658757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/8b2bea2d25005d1568fb79daeb948b04.mp4?t=1755658757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/cbeb4dc0b6b15b87261dc5d62cf04f72.poster.avif?t=1755658757\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/cbeb4dc0b6b15b87261dc5d62cf04f72.webm?t=1755658757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/cbeb4dc0b6b15b87261dc5d62cf04f72.mp4?t=1755658757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, everything is connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defend your frontier, you must train soldiers \u2014 but soldiers need weapons and a strong economy to survive. As the farmer, it\u2019s your responsibility to manage and grow the economy that supports them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/e9f7d4e51f8fcefbcb78e1366b5282c6.avif?t=1755658757\" width=478 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, you will need wood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees and employ woodcutters to process logs into usable wood for constructing buildings. Some structures also require stone, so you\u2019ll need to quarry rocks and refine them into building materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your village by building a fishery, a bakery, and a mill to produce food for your growing population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/f5f0f8c60dd64add1fde14333b99476c.avif?t=1755658757\" width=600 height=359 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your peasants need comfortable homes to rest and eat when they are tired and hungry. Keep their houses stocked with food to keep morale high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn crafting to speed up production and unlock new tools and upgrades that make your frontier thrive.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Pioneer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2468970/a1f5b34f500e11d29058e26b23e891d140961315.jpg"},{"name":"Basic Setup","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2468970/1cb6ea9197d9554e56d2d088ec587ad17e75288e.jpg"},{"name":"Set Sail","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2468970/b6e6739c44eb60afc81ab7283f829de588657988.jpg"},{"name":"Ready for the Journey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2468970/f60fb773376f6388e713ad7e837cddb07a5c0126.jpg"},{"name":"Forged in Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2468970/3814d7e06ca1afc2e159d8b3dd8413b725d10fad.jpg"},{"name":"A Farmer's Wisdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2468970/1bc7b1509969932c61ed07b6bfb2d4facd4dd6d6.jpg"},{"name":"Free Range Beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2468970/7a0341ac2d75d735aaa90021210f82abf985e705.jpg"},{"name":"Moo-velous Rescue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2468970/0330398c6734d28d45ae627e6fdf74c1cc39c64f.jpg"},{"name":"Farmyard Founder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2468970/e4e61864bede1d4b904f21c119ffa269956f3991.jpg"},{"name":"Coin Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2468970/0f25cd5025d51bafedb1486076b7bc9dbf0473d5.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2468970?t=1755658757","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2468970?t=1755658757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/cf4526ee99fd31f2aa20bec164668c5c3390c2fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755658757","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/cf4526ee99fd31f2aa20bec164668c5c3390c2fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755658757","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/2cd96c1144b458e2df805871448a63aa.webp?t=1755658757\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Farming Frontier</strong> is a relaxing farming adventure game where you can chop wood, mine ores, fish, grow crops, bake bread, and raise cattle at your own pace. Alongside the open-ended sandbox gameplay, the game also follows a light, linear story where your farming skills are key to overcoming enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/8b2bea2d25005d1568fb79daeb948b04.poster.avif?t=1755658757\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/8b2bea2d25005d1568fb79daeb948b04.webm?t=1755658757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/8b2bea2d25005d1568fb79daeb948b04.mp4?t=1755658757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/cbeb4dc0b6b15b87261dc5d62cf04f72.poster.avif?t=1755658757\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/cbeb4dc0b6b15b87261dc5d62cf04f72.webm?t=1755658757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/cbeb4dc0b6b15b87261dc5d62cf04f72.mp4?t=1755658757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, everything is connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defend your frontier, you must train soldiers \u2014 but soldiers need weapons and a strong economy to survive. As the farmer, it\u2019s your responsibility to manage and grow the economy that supports them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/e9f7d4e51f8fcefbcb78e1366b5282c6.avif?t=1755658757\" width=478 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, you will need wood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees and employ woodcutters to process logs into usable wood for constructing buildings. Some structures also require stone, so you\u2019ll need to quarry rocks and refine them into building materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your village by building a fishery, a bakery, and a mill to produce food for your growing population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/extras/f5f0f8c60dd64add1fde14333b99476c.avif?t=1755658757\" width=600 height=359 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your peasants need comfortable homes to rest and eat when they are tired and hungry. Keep their houses stocked with food to keep morale high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn crafting to speed up production and unlock new tools and upgrades that make your frontier thrive.</p>","developers":["Cuneyt Aliustaoglu"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468970/71a2aed2104f02914050d8b2ea38c1a4bb52fdea/header.jpg?t=1755658757","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 The Farming Frontier 2025. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nDeveloped by Cuneyt Aliustaoglu","linux_requireme